{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/938181-so-i-ll-be-moving-soon-and-other-thoughts","id":938181,"title":"So, I'll Be Moving Soon....(And Other Thoughts)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-27T09:51:59-07:00","id":938181,"title":"So, I'll Be Moving Soon....(And Other Thoughts)","content":"Well, I've got a major update in my life coming up soon. Also, this thread will be used as a general thread on my thoughts and opinions if that is okay.<br /> <br /> \u200bIn about a week, I will be leaving my current home in Roanoke, Virginia. I will still be in Virginia, but I will be living in the small town of Wise, which is close to where I grew up in my childhood days before moving to Roanoke. For now, I'll be living with my dad until I get a place of my own.<br /> <br /> Wise is a fairly rural area and the cost of living is fairly cheap compared to Roanoke, so overall this is a better move for me. I'm also currently working on my driver's license, which my dad will help me out with. I'm familiar with the area and while it is remote and rural, I don't mind too much. Besides, there's an awesome FLGS in Wise called Cavalier Comics, which is a small yet great place to get stuff for tabletop gaming, comics, anime and manga, and other nerd stuff. Roanoke hasn't had a store like that since Cosmic Castle closed in 2012 (I've heard rumors about a new store in Roanoke having opened up, but I've never been).<br /> <br /> I will miss my friends here in Roanoke but I'm actually kind of looking forward to this move. I'll be reunited with my dad and be closer to the rest of my extended family as well. Wish me the best of luck.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"htt